{
  "exp_name": "exp320_out_ffn",
  "description": "Fork of exp319 (out_input_nap=8, out_proj 8.4M). Adds a BitPermLUT FFN (E->E, same config as out_proj: input_nap=8, output_nap=32, tph=1024 -> 8.4M weights) after out_proj + out_norm, followed by ffn_norm. Doubles bit-LUT capacity per layer via a second stage rather than widening out_proj. 5 bit-LUTs/layer instead of 4.",
